<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#generatesRefusal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a RitualEvent, SacredAgent, or StewardshipMandate to a RefusalEvent. A RitualEvent generates a RefusalEvent when a sacred agent refuses participation, disclosure, or authorization within that event. A SacredAgent generates a RefusalEvent when it is asserted to have refused an action or disclosure request. A StewardshipMandate generates a RefusalEvent when compliance with the mandate results in a documented refusal of access or authorization. The RefusalEvent is documented without adjudicating whether the refusal is theologically binding."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#generatesRefusal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-agency> .
