<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#includesAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a RitualEvent to a constituent RitualAction. Use when finer-grained action typing within an event is required — for example, to distinguish the invocation action from the offering action within a single ceremony. A RitualEvent may include multiple RitualActions. Access: community-only."@en .
