<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasMandate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has mandate"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasMandate> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#minimumAccessLevel> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#access-public-unrestricted> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mandateCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Text description of conditions activating or limiting this stewardship mandate."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SacredAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An entity recognized within a ritual system as capable of intentional action — authorization, refusal, protection, sanctioning, or manifestation. Defined without metaphysical claims. Enables structured modeling of agency in sovereignty-aware archives. Subclass of prov:Agent via iroko-align-prov.ttl."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#RitualEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ritual Event"@en .
