<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-agency> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-framework/> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Spirit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A sacred agent recognized as a spirit within a cultural and ritual framework. Specific typologies (orisha, lwa, nkisi, egun, etc.) modeled via subclasses or concept schemes in domain modules."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#chainLink> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links one node in an AuthorizationChain to the next — the agent, event, or mandate that follows in the delegation sequence."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-agency> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Iroko Historical Society" .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has outcome"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasAuthorizationChain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#AuthorizationChain> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#StewardshipMandate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A mandate asserted to govern stewardship, custody, disclosure, or use of materials. May be associated with agents, events, and access policies. Can condition iroko:AccessPolicy instances."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#involvesAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an event, action, or assertion node to an agent involved. Complements prov:wasAssociatedWith in instance data without requiring PROV import."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mandateScope> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mandateScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Free-text description of the scope of a StewardshipMandate — what materials, processes, or knowledge types it covers."@en .
