<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasAuthorizationChain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Associates a RitualEvent, policy, or mandate with an AuthorizationChain."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#RefusalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ritual event in which a sacred agent is asserted to refuse participation, disclosure, access, or a requested action. Enables modeling of sacred refusal as a positive, governance-significant act rather than merely an absence."@en .
